cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mcp-fdsnws-station: FDSNWS Station MCP Server"
abstract: >-
  An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that exposes the FDSN Web Service
  Station (fdsnws-station 1.1) metadata of any FDSN-compliant datacenter
  (INGV, EarthScope, GFZ, ORFEUS, or a private intranet service) to MCP
  clients as typed network, station, channel and response objects.
type: software
